    { q: "Examine the major debates in the Constituent Assembly regarding Federalism, Language, and Separate Electorates.", ans: "Debates in Constituent Assembly:\n1. Federalism: Strong Centre championed by Ambedkar & Nehru vs. State autonomy championed by K. Santhanam.\n2. Language: Hindi as National vs. Official language debate; compromise reached designating Hindi as official language with English continued for official use.\n3. Separate Electorates: Rejected as divisive; replaced with reservation of seats for SC/ST to ensure social integration.", ch: "Framing the Constitution" }
